 nutrition and diet planning, particularly for patients with specific dietary needs. This expertise is especially crucial for individuals with conditions such as celiac disease, as a specialized dietitian can tailor dietary recommendations to meet their unique requirements.", "CEBADA:La cebada es otro cereal que contiene gluten y es perjudicial para los pacientes con celiaquía.", "AMARANTO:El amaranto es un cereal sin gluten que se puede consumir de forma segura por los pacientes con celiaquía.", "MULTIDISCIPLINARY TEAM:Un equipo multidisciplinario que proporciona seguimiento continuo a pacientes con enfermedad celiaca para supervisar la efectividad del tratamiento.", "CALORIC REQUIREMENTS:Requerimientos calóricos que deben ser calculados y adaptados a las necesidades individuales de los pacientes con enfermedad celiaca.", "DIETARY HABITS:Dietary habits refer to the patterns of food consumption that can significantly impact health outcomes, including cardiovascular health. These habits encompass various aspects of an individual's diet, including the types of foods consumed and the frequency of consumption. Additionally, it is important to consider the previous dietary habits of patients, particularly when adapting to specific dietary requirements, such as following a gluten-free diet. Respecting and adapting these prior habits is crucial for ensuring compliance and promoting overall health in individuals making dietary changes.", "MINISTERIO DE SANIDAD DE ESPAÑA:The Ministry of Health of Spain oversees public health policies and provides guidelines regarding celiac disease and gluten-free diets.", "CELIAC SPRUE ASSOCIATION:The Celiac Sprue Association is a U.S.-based organization that provides support and resources for individuals with celiac disease.", "NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF DIABETES AND DIGESTIVE AND KIDNEY DISEASES:The National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases (NIDDK) is a component of the National Institutes of Health (NIH) that focuses on conducting research and disseminating information related to various health issues. This institute is dedicated to studying digestive diseases, including celiac disease, and also provides valuable information on lactose intolerance. Through its research initiatives and educational resources, the NIDDK aims to enhance understanding and treatment of conditions affecting diabetes, digestive health, and kidney function.", "GLUTEN INTOLERANCE GROUP:The Gluten Intolerance Group is an organization that offers support and resources for individuals with gluten-related disorders."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}